---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Jutt AI Blog" description="Review the privacy policy for Jutt AI Blog and how we handle visitor information." url="/privacy">
  <Navbar />
  <main class="page-shell">
    <section class="content-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</p>
      <h1>Clear privacy. Trusted use.</h1>
      <p>Jutt AI Blog is committed to protecting your privacy while delivering useful AI insights. This policy explains what we collect, why we collect it, and how you can control your information.</p>

      <div class="section">
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>We collect only the information needed to understand site performance and improve your browsing experience. This may include:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>page views and navigation behavior</li>
          <li>anonymous analytics data</li>
          <li>browser and device details</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <p>We use this information to keep the site fast, reliable, and relevant. That includes measuring audience interest, identifying technical issues, and shaping future content.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Third-party services</h2>
        <p>We may use trusted analytics services to help us understand visitor behavior. These services receive only aggregated data and are not used to build personal profiles.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>You can always choose not to provide personal information, and you may opt out of analytics tracking through your browser settings or privacy tools.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Data security</h2>
        <p>We take reasonable measures to protect information from unauthorized access and to maintain its integrity. Our site is designed to minimize the data we store.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions or want to request deletion of your data, email us at <a href="mailto:juttwebsolutions@gmail.com">juttwebsolutions@gmail.com</a>. We respond promptly to privacy inquiries.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-shell { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.25rem 5rem; }
  .content-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 1.4rem; padding: 2rem; box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(15, 32, 67, 0.08); }
  .eyebrow { color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; font-weight: 700; }
  h1 { color: var(--text); font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.7rem); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  h2 { color: var(--text); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2vw, 1.7rem); }
  p, li { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8; }
  ul { padding-left: 1.3rem; margin-top: 0.75rem; }
  li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .section { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
